From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Steinhauf <daniel@steinhauf.eu>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 19:40:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 93/93] clk: wire cix into parent Kconfig/Makefile

0005 creates drivers/clk/cix (CLK_SKY1_ACPI / clk-sky1-acpi, HID
CIXHA010) but CIX's original 00052 only edited files that already
existed in their tree. The parent source/obj-y lines never made it
onto vanilla v7.2.9, so olddefconfig dropped the symbols, CIXHA010
never bound, PCIe PHY deferred, and NVMe never appeared.

Signed-off-by: Daniel Steinhauf <daniel@steinhauf.eu>
---
 drivers/clk/Kconfig  | 1 +
 drivers/clk/Makefile | 1 +
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/clk/Kconfig b/drivers/clk/Kconfig
index 111111111..222222222 100644
--- a/drivers/clk/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/clk/Kconfig
@@ -509,6 +509,7 @@
 source "drivers/clk/analogbits/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/clk/aspeed/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/clk/bcm/Kconfig"
+source "drivers/clk/cix/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/clk/eswin/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/clk/hisilicon/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/clk/imgtec/Kconfig"
diff --git a/drivers/clk/Makefile b/drivers/clk/Makefile
index 111111111..222222222 100644
--- a/drivers/clk/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/clk/Makefile
@@ -119,6 +119,7 @@
 obj-$(CONFIG_ARC_PLAT_AXS10X)		+= axs10x/
 obj-y					+= bcm/
 obj-$(CONFIG_ARCH_BERLIN)		+= berlin/
+obj-$(CONFIG_ARCH_CIX)			+= cix/
 obj-$(CONFIG_ARCH_DAVINCI)		+= davinci/
 obj-$(CONFIG_COMMON_CLK_ESWIN)		+= eswin/
 obj-$(CONFIG_ARCH_HISI)			+= hisilicon/
